---
source: crates/dreamd-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "subcommand_help(\"recall\")"
---
Search stored memories by query, ranked by BM25 × salience (markdown table)

Usage: recall [OPTIONS] <QUERY>

Arguments:
  <QUERY>
          Free-text query (any text; nothing is query syntax), matched with BM25 against stored events and lessons

Options:
  -k, --k <K>
          Maximum results, 0 to 100
          
          [default: 10]

      --explain
          Print each hit's salience factor breakdown

      --without <WITHOUT>
          Drop these event ids before top-k. Repeatable. Does not modify the index

      --without-cluster <WITHOUT_CLUSTER>
          Drop hits whose skill_action equals this prefix or extends it with `::`

  -h, --help
          Print help
